OL,3,GNEWSAPolice arrest 11 at 'successful'
OL,4,ALewes Bonfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSussex Police said it made 11 arrests
OL,7,Fat Lewes Bonfire Night on Thursday - an
OL,8,Fevent it estimates was attended by some
OL,9,F20,000 people.
OL,11,FThe force thanked "everyone who made it
OL,12,Fa successful event" and said it took
OL,13,F"months" of planning by emergency
OL,14,Fservices, local authorities, transport
OL,15,Foperators and the bonfire societies in
OL,16,Fthe town.
OL,18,FThe arrests were in connection with
OL,19,Feight incidents, including assault,
OL,20,Fdrunk and disorderly behaviour,
OL,21,Fcriminal damage and possession of an
OL,22,Foffensive weapon.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
