OL,3,GNEWSAPolice arrest 11 at 'successful'
OL,4,ALewes Bonfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of 01:00 GMT, ambulance crews had
OL,7,Ftreated 52 people. Four were taken to
OL,8,Fhospital for further treatment.
